id: pm-gh1694
title: "GH-1694: recover pinned Bun and verified uploader downloads after GitHub asset gateway failures"
description: "Release42560970081 published npm2026.11.9 but macOS Bun acceptance repeatedly fails before execution because the official Bun1.4.0 darwin-aarch64 asset URL returns HTTP504. The same exact URL with download=1 returns bytes matching the GitHub-published SHA256. Dependabot PR1691 likewise passed full exact coverage and failed only the pinned Codecov CLI asset download. Preserve versions, immutable release identity, no-cache policy, uploader checksum and required checks while making these external-download boundaries recoverable."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[4]: ci,"gh:1694",release,transport
created_at: "2026-11-09T07:50:38.300Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-09T11:57:39.132Z"
closed_at: "2026-11-09T11:57:37.740Z"
completed_at: "2026-11-09T11:57:37.740Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: "macOS registry acceptance installs the same pinned Bun release through an official verified transport; Required Codecov uploads retain fail-closed checksum verification before execution; Focused workflow tests and hosted exact-head checks pass without ignoring mandatory failures; Exact-tag recovery keeps the existing tag and npm identity, with the live publication acceptance outcome tracked by pm-7zs0"
parent: pm-u9d0
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: The authenticated immutable Codecov asset route retains mandatory digest verification. Pinned uncached macOS Bun uses the verified official alternate URL and a required native prepublication runtime check. Executable fixtures assert real binary/auth headers and exact transport/version controls.
expected_result: "Release tools recover the observed gateway failures while preserving exact artifacts, fail-closed uploads and one automatic production tag per UTC day."
actual_result: "Linked release controls pass, including captured curl argv and approved/corrupt bytes; all 232 combined regressions pass. Exact prior head 8e67e43fa passed native macOS setup and pinned runtime acceptance. The daily reminder is re-armed for November10 07UTC. Existing npm9 executors verify; existing-tag advertisement recovery still awaits reviewed main and historical reliability remains red. No second automatic tag was created."
